    <briefdescription>
<para>The reflectance spectrum of the white target used in the scene. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Values are fractions: 0.0 for 0% and 1.0 for 100% reflectivity. A dimensionless curve, so it carries no acquisition context. Pointer validity as in <ref refid="structcuvis__sensor__spectrum__t" kindref="compound">cuvis_sensor_spectrum_t</ref>. Used as the target reference, see <ref refid="group__cuvis__proc_1gabe19a040c876e2bbca0883b0d6780044" kindref="member">cuvis_proc_cont_set_reference_target_spectrum</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
